77
00:18:51.440 --> 00:19:03.269
hanniabu: Cool, cool. So I'm proposing EIP8359, which adds a beacon block body field for the Validator client and setup reporting. Just like to get this out of the way that this is not Consensus-impacting.

78
00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:18.479
hanniabu: But yeah, until we have formal verification, promoting client diversity is still important, but right now, we don't have great data. Today's data comes mostly from crawlers, and more recently, graffiti watermarks.

79
00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.869
hanniabu: But those are insufficient.

80
00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:34.479
hanniabu: Crawlers, they aren't exclusive to validating nodes. They have known issues with reach and peering bias, which can over-under report, client, market share due to that.

81
00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:42.770
hanniabu: Graffiti watermarks, user graffiti overrides it, so data can be either truncated or not included.

82
00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:50.939
hanniabu: And as of a couple days ago, only 60% of blocks, report order marks.

83
00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:56.099
hanniabu: And there's no insight into multi-node setups, such as

84
00:19:56.430 --> 00:20:00.149
hanniabu: dbt, Vero vouch, things like that.

85
00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:05.749
hanniabu: So, this EIP introduces a 32-byte field in the BeaconBlockBody.

86
00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:25.010
hanniabu: Used to report the CL client, EL client, Validator setup types, and client agreement threshold used to verify the correctness of the chain. We're still finalizing the schema, but at the moment, this supports up to, 28 setup types. A setup type could be running a

87
00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:35.950
hanniabu: standalone client, it could be running SSV, Vero, Bouch, Obol, things like that. And, it…

88
00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:45.820
hanniabu: supports a M of N threshold up to 6 at the moment. And 14 client pairs.

89
00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:52.590
hanniabu: With up to 13 CL client options and 13 EL client options.

90
00:20:53.270 --> 00:21:00.380
hanniabu: And again, this field is information only and does not impact consensus. If the field is…

91
00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:06.789
hanniabu: malformed or contains missing data. Luca, are you here? Do you have anything to add to that?

92
