Jerome de Tychey: For now, we perceive that there's a lot of, misconception and good feedback that is being brought to us in terms of what needs to be clarified.

406
01:03:48.530 --> 01:03:59.970
Jerome de Tychey: As time goes, we hope that people will form informed opinions, and hopefully converge to the right thing for the greater good of Ethereum. So, we're going to keep collecting feedback and continue consulting the community.

407
01:04:00.380 --> 01:04:12.029
Jerome de Tychey: There's an additional slide here that shows key figures you can also peruse to sum up the thing. And, yeah, that's it for me. I've only prepared for 3 to 5 minutes.

